<title>USA: NBA BASKETBALL-Linescore for opener of NBA Finals.</title>
<headline>NBA BASKETBALL-Linescore for opener of NBA Finals.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Linescore for the opening game of the best-of-seven NBA Finals, won on Sunday by the defending champion Chicago Bulls:</p>
<p>			  1ST 2ND 3RD 4TH     TOTAL</p>
<p>    UTAH		18  24  22  18	 82</p>
<p>    CHICAGO	   17  21  24  22	 84</p>
<p>HIGH SCORERS:</p>
<p>UTAH - KARL MALONE 23, JOHN STOCKTON 16, JEFF HORNACEK 11</p>
<p>CHICAGO - MICHAEL JORDAN 31, SCOTTIE PIPPEN 27, TONI KUKOC 6, LUC LONGLEY 6</p>
<p>HIGH REBOUNDERS:</p>
<p>UTAH - KARL MALONE 15, GREG OSTERTAG 7, ANTOINE CARR 7</p>
<p>CHICAGO - DENNIS RODMAN 12, SCOTTIE PIPPEN 9</p>
<p>HIGH ASSISTS:</p>
<p>UTAH - JOHN STOCKTON 12</p>
<p>CHICAGO - MICHAEL JORDAN 8 ATTENDANCE:  24,544</p>
</text>
